Overview:
Designed an interactive dashboard to analyze sales performance, opportunity stages, and revenue trends for better business decision-making.

Business Problem:
Lack of visibility into sales pipeline performance and producer contribution made it difficult to identify bottlenecks and optimize revenue generation.

Key Features:

KPI tracking (Revenue, Opportunities, Closed Won, Exceeded Revenue)
Stage-wise opportunity distribution

Producer performance analysis
Monthly revenue trend visualization
Interactive filtering (Stage, Producer, Date)

Key Insights:

Closed Won stage contributes the highest revenue share (46%)
Top producer drives a significant portion of revenue
Revenue shows fluctuation with a noticeable dip mid-year
Strong early-stage pipeline indicates future growth potential.


Tools Used:
Power BI, DAX, Power Query, Data Modeling
